(Let's outline plan steps:)
(Initial state:)
(- origin_availability_alpha: created, prepared, vehicle_allocated alpha, task_profile_linked, origin_node linked, origin_node_ready, origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_confirmed, origin_availability_locked, etc.)
(- destination_availability_alpha: similar but with vehicle_beta, destination_node occupied/ready/confirmed/locked.)
(- shift_candidate_alpha: created, prepared, vehicle_allocated gamma, task_profile_linked? Actually not; we have candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha only, not shift_candidate_alpha. So shift_candidate_alpha lacks task_profile_linked. But shift_candidate_alpha is already finalized and dispatched, etc. Not needed.)
(- shift_candidate_beta: created, candidate_prepared? false. candidate_vehicle_linked? false. candidate_task_profile_linked? false. candidate_operator_linked? false. candidate_skill_certificate_linked? false. candidate_compliance_certificate_linked? false (but it's linked to alpha). candidate_loading_container_linked loading_container_beta true. candidate_transport_leg_linked transport_leg_alpha true. cargo_available true. loading_containers alpha and beta available. equipment resources available. service windows available. skill_certificate available. compliance_certificate_alpha linked to alpha (so not available). operator_available driver_operator_alpha. vehicle_unit_gamma available.)
(Now we need to prepare shift_candidate_beta.)
(Step 1: allocate vehicle gamma to shift_candidate_beta.)
(Action: allocate_vehicle_unit ?candidate shift_candidate_beta ?vehicle_unit vehicle_unit_gamma)
(Preconditions: candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (true), not (vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta) (true), vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma (true). Effect: vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta true, candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_gamma true, (not vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma). So gamma becomes allocated.)
(Step 2: attach task profile route_task_profile_alpha to shift_candidate_beta.)
(Action: attach_task_profile ?candidate shift_candidate_beta ?route_task_profile route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (true), vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta (true after step1), route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha (true). Effect: candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha true, (not route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha). So profile becomes unavailable.)
(Step 3: confirm candidate preparedness.)
(Action: confirm_candidate_preparedness ?candidate shift_candidate_beta ?route_task_profile route_task_profile_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_created shift_candidate_beta (true), vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_beta (true), candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha (true), not (candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta) (true). Effect: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta true.)
(Now we have candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta.)
(Step 4: assign operator driver_operator_alpha to shift_candidate_beta.)
(Action: assign_operator_resource ?candidate shift_candidate_beta ?operator_resource driver_operator_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (true), operator_available driver_operator_alpha (true). Effect: candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha true, (not operator_available driver_operator_alpha). So operator becomes unavailable.)
(Step 5: assign skill certificate alpha to shift_candidate_beta.)
(Action: assign_skill_certificate ?candidate shift_candidate_beta ?skill_certificate skill_certificate_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (true), skill_certificate_available skill_certificate_alpha (true). Effect: candidate_skill_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha true, (not skill_certificate_available skill_certificate_alpha).)
(Step 6: release compliance certificate from shift_candidate_alpha to make it available.)
(Action: release_compliance_certificate ?candidate shift_candidate_alpha ?compliance_certificate compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Precondition: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha (true). Effect: compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha true, (not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha).)
(Step 7: assign compliance certificate alpha to shift_candidate_beta.)
(Action: assign_compliance_certificate ?candidate shift_candidate_beta ?compliance_certificate compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Preconditions: candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (true), compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha (true after release). Effect: candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta compliance_certificate_alpha true, (not compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha).)
(Now we have operator, skill, compliance linked.)
(Step 8: allocate dispatch slot for shift_candidate_beta? Actually we need dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_beta before we can execute dispatch. But we also need dispatch_ready shift_candidate_beta. We'll get dispatch_ready after finalize_candidate_direct. However allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate requires dispatch_ready ?candidate. So we need dispatch_ready first. So we need to make shift_candidate_beta dispatch_ready via finalize_candidate_direct after establishing clearance etc. But we also need to load container onto leg etc before clearance.)
(Thus we need to do loading sequence first, then establish clearance, then finalize, then allocate dispatch slot, then execute dispatch.)
(But we also need to allocate dispatch slot for origin and destination availability; they also need dispatch_ready first.)
(Thus we need to assemble transport leg, authorize loading, then mark origin and destination dispatch ready, then allocate dispatch slots for them, execute dispatch (freeing vehicles), then later for shift_candidate_beta we need to load container onto leg, stage, verify loading, establish clearance, finalize, allocate dispatch slot, execute dispatch.)
(But note: after we execute dispatch for origin and destination, their vehicles become available (fulfilling goal). Also after we dispatch shift_candidate_beta, vehicle gamma will become available (not required but okay).)
(Now we need to ensure we have transport_leg_assembled and transport_leg_loading_authorized before marking origin/destination dispatch ready and before loading container onto leg.)
(Thus steps:)
(- Assemble transport leg (using assemble_transport_leg))
(- Authorize transport leg loading (authorize_transport_leg_loading))
(- Mark origin availability dispatch ready (mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready))
(- Mark destination availability dispatch ready (mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready))
(Now we have origin and destination dispatch_ready true.)
(Now allocate dispatch slots for origin and destination (and later for shift_candidate_beta). However we need to ensure we have task_profile_linked for origin and destination. They already have task_profile_linked from init (origin_availability_alpha has candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha; destination_availability_alpha also? init includes candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha only; not for destination. Need to check: init has (candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha). No mention for destination. So destination_availability_alpha lacks task_profile_linked. We need to attach task profile to destination_availability_alpha as well.)
(Thus before allocating dispatch slot for destination_availability_alpha, we need to attach task profile.)
(Similarly origin_availability_alpha already has task_profile_linked.)
(Thus steps:)
(- attach_task_profile for destination_availability_alpha.)
(Now allocate dispatch slot for origin_availability_alpha (requires dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, dispatch_slot_available, not dispatch_allocated). After we allocate, dispatch_slot becomes unavailable.)
(Then execute_origin_dispatch (origin_availability_alpha, vehicle_unit_alpha?, dispatch_slot). Wait execute_origin_dispatch parameters: ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?vehicle_unit - vehicle_unit ?dispatch_slot - dispatch_slot. Precondition: dispatch_allocated ?origin_availability, candidate_vehicle_linked ?origin_availability ?vehicle_unit, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?origin_availability ?dispatch_slot, not (dispatched ?origin_availability). Effect: dispatched ?origin_availability, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot.)
(Thus we need to know which vehicle unit is linked to origin_availability_alpha: from init, candidate_vehicle_linked origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha. So we use that.)
(After execution, vehicle_unit_alpha becomes available, dispatch_slot_available becomes true.)
(Similarly for destination: we need to allocate dispatch slot after attaching task profile, then execute_destination_dispatch with vehicle_unit_beta.)
(Now after those two dispatches, dispatch_slot_alpha becomes available again.)
(Now we need to prepare shift_candidate_beta loading sequence.)
(We need to load container onto leg: load_container_onto_leg requires candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (we have after step3), candidate_transport_leg_linked shift_candidate_beta transport_leg_alpha (true), candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta (true), loading_container_available loading_container_beta (true), transport_leg_assembled (true after step assemble), transport_leg_loading_authorized (true after authorize), not loading_container_loaded loading_container_beta (currently false). So we can load.)
(After loading, we have loading_container_loaded and loading_container_leg_linked.)
(Now we need to stage schedule candidate: stage_schedule_candidate requires candidate_prepared shift_candidate_beta (true), candidate_loading_container_linked (true), loading_container_loaded (true), loading_container_leg_linked (true), candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha (we attached earlier), not origin_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (false), not candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta (false). So we can stage.)
(After staging, we have candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta true.)
(Now verify loading profile nominal: verify_loading_profile_nominal requires candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta (true), candidate_skill_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha (true after step5), candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha (true after step4), candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta (true), loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha (true after load), not destination_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (false), not candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_beta (false). So we can verify.)
(After verification, candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_beta true.)
(Now establish clearance nominal: establish_clearance_nominal requires candidate_loading_verified shift_candidate_beta (true), candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_beta compliance_certificate_alpha (true after step7), candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta (true), loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha (true), not origin_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (false), not destination_leg_loaded transport_leg_alpha (false), not candidate_clearance_established shift_candidate_beta (false). So we can establish clearance.)
(After that, candidate_clearance_established shift_candidate_beta true.)
(Now finalize candidate direct: finalize_candidate_direct requires candidate_clearance_established shift_candidate_beta (true), not route_sequence_context_set shift_candidate_beta (we haven't set it), not candidate_finalized shift_candidate_beta (false). Effect: candidate_finalized shift_candidate_beta true, dispatch_ready shift_candidate_beta true.)
(Now we have dispatch_ready shift_candidate_beta.)
(Now allocate dispatch slot for shift_candidate_beta: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate requires dispatch_ready shift_candidate_beta (true), candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha (true), dispatch_slot_available (true after we released from previous dispatches), not dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_beta (false). Effect: dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_beta true, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_beta dispatch_slot_alpha true, not dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha.)
(Now execute dispatch for shift_candidate_beta: execute_schedule_dispatch ?candidate shift_candidate_beta ?vehicle_unit vehicle_unit_gamma ?dispatch_slot dispatch_slot_alpha. Preconditions: dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_beta true, candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_gamma (true from step1), candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_beta dispatch_slot_alpha (true just allocated), not dispatched shift_candidate_beta (false). Effect: dispatched shift_candidate_beta true, vehicle_available vehicle_unit_gamma true, dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha true.)
